title: "AYAP-1 lunar impact: observability study and interactive site (impact-live)"
version: 2.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
authors:
  - family-names: Solmaz
    given-names: Arif
    affiliation: "Istanbul Health and Technology University (İSTÜN)"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AYAP-1
  - lunar impact
  - impact flash
  - observability
  - public engagement
abstract: >-
  Open, reproducible analysis of whether the end-of-mission lunar impact of
  Türkiye's AYAP-1 spacecraft could be observed from Earth, from where and with
  which equipment, together with a bilingual (Turkish/English) interactive
  website and an impact-day live page. Impact sites and dates are hypothetical
  test scenarios, not official mission targets.
